
This is the structures, autodocs, includes and examples for developers.

There  are  som  example  sources  with guidelines on how to code doors for
DayDream in AmigaE, SasC, Gnu CC, StormC and Assembler.

If  you  have  created  includes/modules/examples  for  DayDream in another
language  or  variation than the ones stated above, feel free to contact me
and I can put those files in the developer archive in future releases.

Have fun!

// Mattias Nilsson.
